        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "ba84e225-0c55-5c92-ab05-c275b91c7801",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 1974 South African Grand Prix\n- Places: Kyalami Racing Circuit, Midrand, Gauteng, South Africa\n- Products: BRM P201\n- People: Jean-Pierre Beltoise\n- Topics: Formula One\n\nFacts:\n- The 1974 South African Grand Prix was a Formula One motor race held at Kyalami on 30 March 1974.\n- Kyalami Racing Circuit is a motor racing circuit in Midrand, Gauteng province, South Africa.\n- The BRM P201 made its debut at the 1974 South African Grand Prix.\n- Jean-Pierre Beltoise finished second in a BRM P201 at the 1974 South African Grand Prix, which was the car's best result.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
